      },
      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/31-wasm-file-picker\n\nConflicts in crates/ui/src/state.rs, kept both sides: main's\nstate_browser module and Save/Save As download arms beside the picker's\nmodule and OpenPicked arm; open_project_path keeps reset_for_open, which\nnow also clears main's shown_setups.\n\nSemantic merge with #1431: main refused Open model / Open project in the\nbrowser \"until the browser file picker (#31)\" lands. This branch is that\npicker, so browser_files::refusal no longer refuses them (NEEDS_PICKER\nnow names the pickers still owed), and the #1431 tests assert the two\ncells live in the browser instead of dark.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
